{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"6d48b410-94f6-420d-83ae-2da39acd5dee","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":684372,"messageId":684372,"newsId":636959,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - third tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the third tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 22 July 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 23 July to no later than 26 October 2026.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 22 July 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/678529\n\nFrom 12 October to 16 October 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n540,275 own shares at an average price of NOK 425.4849 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Date             |Trading    |              |       Daily|                    |\n|                 |venue      |    Aggregated|    weighted|                    |\n|                 |           |  daily volume|     average|         Total daily|\n|                 |           |    (number of| share price|   transaction value|\n|                 |           |       shares)|       (NOK)|               (NOK)|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|12 October       |OSE        |       137,775|    418.3224|       57,634,368.66|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|13 October       |OSE        |       137,500|    420.9934|       57,886,592.50|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|14 October       |OSE        |       132,000|    431.5169|       56,960,230.80|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|15 October       |OSE        |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|16 October       |OSE        |       133,000|    431.5615|       57,397,679.50|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total for the    |OSE        |              |            |                    |\n|period           |           |       540,275|    425.4849|      229,878,871.46|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Previously       |OSE        |     7,697,832|    396.5241|    3,052,375,860.73|\n|disclosed buy-   +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|backs under the  |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|tranche          +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     7,697,832|    396.5241|    3,052,375,860.73|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total buy-backs  |OSE        |     8,238,107|    398.4234|    3,282,254,732.19|\n|under the tranche+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|(accumulated)    |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     8,238,107|    398.4234|    3,282,254,732.19|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n23,077,317 own shares, corresponding to 0.97% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 11,773,082 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.49% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n